## 4. MCP Tools Design

### Tool Inventory

| Tool | Description | Use Case |
|------|-------------|----------|
| `ask_agent` | Ask a specific agent a question | When user wants a specific agent's opinion |
| `ask_all` | Ask all available agents in parallel | When user wants to compare responses |
| `consult` | Smart-route to the best agent | When user wants the "best" answer automatically |
| `list_agents` | List detected and available agents | Discovery / diagnostics |
| `list_models` | List models available per agent | Configuration discovery |

