### 4.3 `consult` Tool

```typescript
server.registerTool(
  'consult',
  {
    title: 'Consult',
    description: 'Smart-route a question to the best available agent based on task type. ' +
                 'Optionally asks multiple agents and synthesizes the best answer.',
    inputSchema: {
